│ Background service                                                           │
│                                                                              │
│ [x] Install the otag daemon (launchd)                                        │
│                                                                              │
│ The daemon (launch agent io.github.nesiler.otag) reaps crashed runs,         │
│ restarts stalled ones, falls back to another profile on quota limits and     │
│ retries queued messages. Same as `otag daemon install`; `otag daemon         │
│ uninstall` removes it.                                                       │
